2. Purpose

Suggested wording

The purpose of this technical specification is to define the technical solution for securing sensitive usernames and passwords currently maintained in plaintext within the external properties configuration file used by the backend routine.

The proposed solution will eliminate plaintext storage of sensitive credentials by encrypting the credentials using AES-256 encryption and maintaining the encryption key separately in a secured location with restricted access.

The solution will integrate with the existing Spring ResourceBundleMessageSource based configuration mechanism to minimize impact to the existing backend routine framework and business functionality.

