8. Proposed Configuration Format

The existing:

external.username=myuser
external.password=MyPassword123

will become:

external.username=myuser
external.password=ENC(v1:<IV>:<ciphertext>)

You can state:

The ENC(...) prefix will identify values that require decryption. Non-sensitive properties will continue to be read without modification.

For example:

external.host=sftp.company.com
external.port=22
external.username=myuser
external.password=ENC(v1:...)
external.timeout=60000

This is a good design because you don’t need to encrypt the entire properties file.

